      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heisson%2C_Washington",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Henry Heisen House, built by Heisen’s son, is listed on the National Register of Historic Places.",
